{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38543","headline":"僧舍白牡丹二首 一 · 吴融","name":"僧舍白牡丹二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"腻若裁云薄缀霜，春残独自殿羣芳。\n梅妆向日霏霏暖，纨扇摇风闪闪光。\n月魄照来空见影，露华凝後更多香。\n天生洁白宜清净，何必殷红暎洞房。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38543.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38543","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}